<title>FRANCE: Block trade of 400,000 Havas shares at 429 francs.</title>
<headline>Block trade of 400,000 Havas shares at 429 francs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 400,000 shares in Havas was placed on Tuesday at a price of 429 francs per share, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>At 1051 GMT, Havas was 0.25 percent higher at 433.50 francs.</p>
</text>
